Node ID=300 Signor Leo
Text=Signor Leo? Loco como un zorro <crazy like a fox>. He has lived a long time and has become addled in his old age, but he's harmless. Over the years, he has contributed much to the culture of this city. He paints masterful works of art, creates wondrous inventions, and pushes the boundaries of many disciplines of science.
